('c4c6ef28-0da0-5a94-bc45-12ae464cb55a','7862dc84-72d6-40a9-b2b1-c7c7896bc148','f320bff8-4d4d-509c-9e92-6db67dd98f0a','Add optical signal-strength monitoring for switch uplinks.','Add optical signal-strength monitoring for switch uplinks','monitoring','medium','82ce8a8d-1bb9-5b4c-bea8-3e2d9c93b049','f301105e-96ff-5a0b-8543-883f155dfec3','2026-08-05T12:00:00','done','Confirmed signal-strength metric now visible on the network dashboard with an alert threshold.','82ce8a8d-1bb9-5b4c-bea8-3e2d9c93b049','2026-07-28T12:00:00')
