('e994dba0-29d3-5747-a828-0f06f4304d7a','56cc885c-37d4-5dc6-900d-1a7a6defec8b','3aa666ec-85fe-5825-9f17-78bf3e21e62d','Add optical signal-strength monitoring for switch uplinks.','Add optical signal-strength monitoring for switch uplinks','monitoring','medium','6da32b93-6f3d-5f80-b6e7-69cba3f13e38','b3db1fc9-30e0-51f3-bfe8-1acbee2fb127','2026-08-05T12:00:00','done','Confirmed signal-strength metric now visible on the network dashboard with an alert threshold.','6da32b93-6f3d-5f80-b6e7-69cba3f13e38','2026-07-28T12:00:00')
